<title>UK: Countrywide Corp adds $100 mln to five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Countrywide Corp adds $100 mln to five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to $250 million from $150 million, lead manager UBS said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNTRYWIDE CORP LTD (HONG KONG BRANCH)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COUNTRYWIDE BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMT  * $250 MLN	SPREAD     15 BP     MATURITY    05.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    05.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.82     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.82</p>
<p> NOTES    * LAUNCHED FOR $150 MLN ON AUGUST 12</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/SING  REPAYMENT   BULLETT</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/SING/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NZ	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELLING    12.5</p>
<p>NOTES	** GUARANTOR IS RATED SINGLE A BY S&amp;P, AND IS 100</p>
<p>		PERCENT OWNED BY THE BANK OF SCOTLAND</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
